00:06:24.557 --> 00:06:26.823
We need leaders in America who can do it.

00:06:26.823 --> 00:06:29.856
If you want to become somebody do it.

00:06:29.856 --> 00:06:32.774
If you want to go in
business for yourself do it.

00:06:32.774 --> 00:06:35.770
If you want to become
financially independent do it.

