With all of that A.L. Williams
grew for 20 straight years.

00:24:30.539 --> 00:24:32.048
Now how do you grow?

00:24:32.048 --> 00:24:33.817
This is the difference in a pro.

00:24:33.817 --> 00:24:37.950
A real pro and an average
and ordinary coach.

00:24:37.950 --> 00:24:40.632
There are three things you do now

00:24:40.632 --> 00:24:44.799
to guarantee you keep momentum
when you get it goin'.

00:24:45.726 --> 00:24:48.893
Number one you grow by multiplication.

00:24:50.892 --> 00:24:53.142
You grow by multiplication.

00:24:58.384 --> 00:25:02.508
You've got to always be promoting people.

00:25:02.508 --> 00:25:04.653
To district leader to division leader

00:25:04.653 --> 00:25:08.486
to RVP okay because once
you get things growin

00:25:09.920 --> 00:25:11.420
by multiplication,

00:25:16.371 --> 00:25:20.206
then what you have are
you have hundreds then,

00:25:20.206 --> 00:25:23.539
hundreds of thousands of people that are

00:25:24.951 --> 00:25:28.548
doing what you are trying to do okay?

00:25:28.548 --> 00:25:30.155
Building friends.

00:25:30.155 --> 00:25:32.250
Praise and recognizing people.

00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:34.709
Recruiting best friends.

00:25:34.709 --> 00:25:36.290
Does that make sense?

00:25:36.290 --> 00:25:39.468
And so once you're
growing by multiplication,

00:25:39.468 --> 00:25:43.015
that's the greatest opportunity for you

00:25:43.015 --> 00:25:46.179
to keep that momentum that you've kept.

00:25:46.179 --> 00:25:47.244
Okay?

00:25:47.244 --> 00:25:48.448
That make sense?

00:25:48.448 --> 00:25:49.475
Alright number two.

00:25:49.475 --> 00:25:52.766
The second thing in keeping this momentum

00:25:52.766 --> 00:25:56.766
once you have it is you've
got to have an enemy.

00:25:59.445 --> 00:26:03.115
You've got to have some
kind of injustice out there.

00:26:03.115 --> 00:26:04.219
You're trying to create.

00:26:04.219 --> 00:26:06.058
You've got to have an edge.

00:26:06.058 --> 00:26:06.985
I don't care

00:26:06.985 --> 00:26:09.571
if you're in the real
estate business right?

00:26:09.571 --> 00:26:14.494
If somebody's chargin' let's
say a 10 percent commission

00:26:14.494 --> 00:26:17.637
on just raw land that you sell out there,

00:26:17.637 --> 00:26:19.312
then you do it for
eight and a half percent

00:26:19.312 --> 00:26:22.410
or something you've got to
have an edge over the enemy.

00:26:22.410 --> 00:26:24.089
You've got to have an enemy you're trying

00:26:24.089 --> 00:26:26.500
to beat out there right?

00:26:26.500 --> 00:26:28.251
Now we were fortunate
to have the worst enemy

00:26:28.251 --> 00:26:29.918
in the whole history of the world right?

00:26:29.918 --> 00:26:32.556
The trash value guys right?

00:26:32.556 --> 00:26:34.694
But you're selling a crusade.

00:26:34.694 --> 00:26:36.217
There's nothing that energizes people

00:26:36.217 --> 00:26:37.994
and keep that momentum goin'

00:26:37.994 --> 00:26:40.003
like a crusade right?

00:26:40.003 --> 00:26:41.644
You're out there trying to save the world.

00:26:41.644 --> 00:26:44.870
You're trying to make a
difference with your life right?

00:26:44.870 --> 00:26:49.419
And then the third thing
is you have competition.

00:26:49.419 --> 00:26:52.002
Competition inside the company.

00:26:54.515 --> 00:26:57.344
I was a master in promoting competition

00:26:57.344 --> 00:26:59.427
inside the company right?

00:27:00.337 --> 00:27:04.504
Like Lawrence Walker I get
him taking on Dick Walker.

00:27:07.673 --> 00:27:09.653
You know down in Tampa Florida.

00:27:09.653 --> 00:27:13.820
I had a gift of always egging
people along a little bit.

00:27:15.963 --> 00:27:19.713
So if you want to keep
momentum once you get it

00:27:20.871 --> 00:27:22.496
there are three keys.

00:27:22.496 --> 00:27:24.461
You grow by multiplication.

00:27:24.461 --> 00:27:25.462
You keep recruiting.

00:27:25.462 --> 00:27:26.758
Listen to this folks.

00:27:26.758 --> 00:27:29.902
For 20 years as President
of A.L. Williams,

00:27:29.902 --> 00:27:33.493
the first thing I look for everyday

00:27:33.493 --> 00:27:35.079
on my desk, Kathy Harry my secretary

00:27:35.079 --> 00:27:36.907
the first thing I did
when I went in the office

00:27:36.907 --> 00:27:39.544
before I talked to Beau or anybody

00:27:39.544 --> 00:27:42.789
and got in my million
things I needed to do okay?

00:27:42.789 --> 00:27:45.166
The first thing I did every morning

00:27:45.166 --> 00:27:47.630
was look at recruiting numbers.

00:27:47.630 --> 00:27:49.489
First thing I did every morning.

00:27:49.489 --> 00:27:53.067
The second thing I did was
sign 200 go-go letters.

00:27:53.067 --> 00:27:54.092
That's the first thing I did

00:27:54.092 --> 00:27:55.669
and got that out of the way.

00:27:55.669 --> 00:27:57.757
First thing every morning right?

00:27:57.757 --> 00:27:59.294
And so you've got to have way.

00:27:59.294 --> 00:28:00.545
I'm going to talk to you about that

00:28:00.545 --> 00:28:02.879
in a morning to monitoring
this kind of stuff

00:28:02.879 --> 00:28:06.657
so when you know, you
anticipate when you are slowin'

00:28:06.657 --> 00:28:09.029
down right when you're
fixing to hit a brick wall

00:28:09.029 --> 00:28:10.711
down the road correct?

00:28:10.711 --> 00:28:14.169
So if you're growin' by multiplication,

00:28:14.169 --> 00:28:17.780
if you've got people out
there recruiting best friends.

00:28:17.780 --> 00:28:20.652
You're picking up
policies of best friends,

00:28:20.652 --> 00:28:23.870
making presentations to best friends.

00:28:23.870 --> 00:28:26.210
Building friends with their recruits,

00:28:26.210 --> 00:28:28.291
praising recognizing people.

00:28:28.291 --> 00:28:30.155
Promoting district managers.

00:28:30.155 --> 00:28:31.369
Promoting division managers,

00:28:31.369 --> 00:28:35.580
promoting RVP's and you're teaching people

00:28:35.580 --> 00:28:38.024
how to do all these same kind of things

00:28:38.024 --> 00:28:41.191
to build these powerful
relationships right?

00:28:41.191 --> 00:28:43.199
Then you're guaranteed
you're going to keep

00:28:43.199 --> 00:28:44.519
that momentum going.

00:28:44.519 --> 00:28:46.323
If you have an enemy

00:28:46.323 --> 00:28:47.540
you've got to have an enemy,

00:28:47.540 --> 00:28:48.821
you've got to have something you

00:28:48.821 --> 00:28:50.573
can get people riled up about

00:28:50.573 --> 00:28:53.893
and then the third things
is you create competition

00:28:53.893 --> 00:28:58.060
inside your own organization
or inside the company right?

